        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Mazda, Ohio Assembly\n- Products: Ford Escape, Mazda Tribute\n- Concepts: platform sharing, design inspiration\n\nFacts:\n- Mazda manufactured the sports car that inspired the design of the Ford Escape platform.\n- The Ford Escape and the Mazda Tribute shared the same underpinnings.\n- Ohio Assembly produced the Ford Escape until 2005.",
